# Crash/ANR reporting DSN — copy to `sentry.properties` (gitignored) and fill in once a Sentry
# project exists for Passwordy. Absent this file (the default), CrashReporting.init() is a no-op
# and no SDK network calls are made.
#
# 1. Create a free project at https://sentry.io (or self-host) — platform: Android.
# 2. Copy its DSN (Settings → Client Keys (DSN)) below.
# 3. Rebuild the release variant.
#
# Crash reporting is only ever active in release builds (CrashReporting.kt hard-gates on
# !BuildConfig.DEBUG) — a developer's local crashes never get reported regardless of this file.
dsn=https://examplePublicKey@o0.ingest.sentry.io/0
